JEA211 - Joel Anderson
rrl88 - Ryan Lily

CURRENT TESTS:

=====================CONNECTION==================

-valid_name:
Client connects with a valid name → receives welcome message

-duplicate_name:
Two clients attempt the same username → second receives ERR (Name in use)

-bad_length_name:
Name length does not match specified length → error + disconnect

-missing_pipe_name:
NAM message missing trailing | → error + disconnect

-bad_version:
Client sends version != 1 → error + disconnect

-wrong_first_type:
Client sends something other than NAM first → error + disconnect

======================MESSAGING==================

-public_message:
Client sends message to #all → all other clients receive it

-private_message:
Client sends message to another user → only that user receives it

-unknown_recipient:
Message sent to non-existent user → ERR (Unknown Recipient)

-long_message:
Message close to 80 character limit → still delivered correctly

-malformed_msg:
Missing pipes or incorrect format → error + disconnect

======================STATUS=====================

-set_status:
User sets a valid status → broadcast message appears

-empty_status:
User sets empty status → no broadcast occurs

-long_status:
Status > 64 characters → ERR (Too Long)

-status_update_multiple:
User changes status multiple times → each update handled correctly

=======================WHO=======================

-who_single_with_status:
Query user with status → returns name: status

-who_single_no_status:
Query user without status → returns No status

-who_all:
Query #all → returns list of all active users

-who_unknown:
Query non-existent user → ERR (Unknown Recipient)

-multiple_users:
Multiple users connected → verify all appear in WHO response

======================ERRORS=====================

-unreadable_message:
Incomplete or broken message → ERR (Unreadable) + disconnect

-mismatched_length:
Declared length != actual length → error + disconnect

-missing_pipe:
Message does not end in | → error + disconnect

-unknown_type:
Invalid message type → error + disconnect

-pipe_misplacement:
Incorrect field structure → error + disconnect

====================CONCURRENCY==================

-multiple_clients:
5+ clients connected simultaneously → all operate correctly

-simultaneous_messages:
Multiple clients send messages at same time → no crashes, messages delivered properly

-name_race_condition:
Two clients attempt same name at same time → only one succeeds

-broadcast_stress:
Multiple users sending to #all rapidly → all messages delivered without corruption

====================DISCONNECT===================

-client_disconnect:
Client exits normally → server frees slot

-abrupt_disconnect:
Client closes unexpectedly → server handles without crashing

-reconnect:
New client connects after disconnect → slot reused correctly
